# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Greedy selection**: Accept improvements that lower the cost function\n"
msgstr "**Selección voraz**: Aceptar mejoras que reduzcan la función de costo\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Multiple passes**: Perform several passes (controlled by "
